{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16822","headline":"步虚词十九首 三 · 韦渠牟","name":"步虚词十九首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上帝求仙使，真符取玉郎。\n三才闲布象，二景郁生光。\n骑吏排龙虎，笙歌走凤皇。\n天高人不见，暗入白云乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦渠牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}